-- `else` or `elseif` on the line after `}` of an `if` that is the value of an
-  assignment (`$count = if (...) { } NEWLINE else { }`, also inside `@{ }`). The stock
-  grammar accepted it as a separate command named `else`; it is an `else_clause`
